  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 102.56 “Design volume” means the maximum in-place volume of waste, including cover materials, to be received at a landfill during its active life.\n\nSource. #14103, eff 10-23-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
